  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Sport for Development program (2026-2036)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total allocation over full 10 year investment 2025-2026 = $60,400,000 for core funding, but it will need to include the option to be scalable for bilateral and other additional contributions.. 
